>> title: Doro Wat
>> category: Stews & Braises
>> tags: chicken, berbere, ethiopian, onion, stew
>> counters: Curry House, One Pot
>> aka: doro wot, doro wet, chicken wat, Ethiopian chicken stew
>> servings: 6
>> time: 2 hr

Cook down @red onions{3%lb}(1.4 kg; finely chopped) dry in a heavy #pot{} for ~{40%min}.

>> step: stir in
Stir @niter kibbeh{1/2%cup}(110 g; spiced clarified butter), @berbere{1/2%cup}(60 g), @garlic{6%cloves}(grated), @fresh ginger{2%Tbs}(grated) into @&(~1)onions{}.

>> step: simmer covered 45 min
Simmer @chicken drumsticks{3%lb}(1.4 kg; skin removed), @chicken stock{2%cup}(475 mL), @kosher salt{2%tsp} with @&(~1)berbere base{} for ~{45%min}.

Nestle @hard-boiled eggs{6}(peeled and scored) into @&(~1)wat{}.
